# ── build & tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules
dist
.DS_Store
*.local
.env
.env.*

# ── ЛИЙД ДАННИ — НИКОГА В GIT ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This app handles real contact data: owner names and phone numbers of actual
# companies. Every artefact the app can produce is an export of that data.
#
# Committed:     source code, configs, and the seed script text in
#                src/seed/autoclick.ts (sales copy — no customer data in it).
# Never committed: anything a lead ever passed through.
#
# The app's own outputs, by the exact names it writes:
#   · Експорт CSV   → "<кампания>-<дата>.csv"       (leads: names, phones, statuses)
#   · Експорт JSON  → "callcockpit-<дата>.json"     (the ENTIRE state, all campaigns)
*.csv
callcockpit-*.json
autoclick-ready.json

# Named patterns above are not enough on their own — a state file saved under any
# other name would sail straight through. So: NO json at the repo root except the
# handful that are genuinely config. Anything else there is assumed to be data.
# (Only matches the root; src/**.json and .claude/launch.json are unaffected.)
/*.json
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/tsconfig.json

# Any directory used to stage or archive lead lists.
exports/
data/
leads/
backup/
backups/

# Loose scratch/backup files that tend to collect lead data.
*.bak
*.orig
*~
scratch/
